{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A darkness creeps into a man's life, twisting his reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>FORCE RESTART</strong></i>, a first-person psychological survival horror thriller, explore mind-bending worlds and experience haunting storytelling as you struggle to escape the VOID.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/fb622ab2529732ff08410af421059f1d.avif?t=1767496589\" width=1080 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See For Yourself - </strong>Get up close in a suspenseful, first-person experience that stretches the boundaries of reality with literal twists, turns, and mind-bending worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/882ce1debdac78f36c839627ca529e0d.poster.avif?t=1767496589\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/882ce1debdac78f36c839627ca529e0d.webm?t=1767496589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/882ce1debdac78f36c839627ca529e0d.mp4?t=1767496589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch Your Back - </strong>Scavenge limited resources, manage your inventory, and survive encounters where every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/14dd73856618a1adb126ed9b8fdd0ebc.poster.